## Phase A — Pro contract pytest (no Qwen weights)

**Minimum** (GitHub `kie-phase-a.yml` on PR):

```bash
cd "$REPO_ROOT/backend"
source ~/docuvision_env/bin/activate
pytest tests/test_kie_field_metrics.py tests/test_kie_service.py \
  tests/test_kie_return_raw_contract.py tests/test_orchestrator_order.py -q
```

**v1.3 pre-release extension**:

```bash
cd "$REPO_ROOT/backend"
source ~/docuvision_env/bin/activate
pytest tests/test_kie_pages_parse.py tests/test_kie_field_merge.py \
  tests/test_batch_export_service.py \
  tests/test_kie_field_validation.py tests/test_kie_schema_templates.py \
  tests/test_document_type_classifier.py tests/test_file_type_detector.py \
  tests/test_kie_field_metrics.py tests/test_kie_service.py \
  tests/test_kie_return_raw_contract.py tests/test_orchestrator_order.py -q

cd "$REPO_ROOT/packages/docuvision-core"
pip install -e ".[lite,dev]" && pytest tests/processing/test_table_stitch.py -q
```

**Lite on PR** (GitHub `ci-lite.yml`, not Cloud GPU required):

```bash
cd "$REPO_ROOT/apps/lite/backend"
pip install -r requirements-lite.txt
pip install -e "../../../packages/docuvision-core[lite,dev]"
python -m pytest tests/ -q
```

**Lite preview E2E** (CI Lite on PR; CPU, starts `run_lite.py` via Playwright):

```bash
cd "$REPO_ROOT/frontend"
npm install
npx playwright install chromium
npm run test:e2e:lite
```

From `apps/lite/frontend/` (delegates to `frontend/`):

```bash
cd "$REPO_ROOT/apps/lite/frontend"
npm run test:e2e   # requires frontend/node_modules from step above
```

Contract only:

```bash
cd "$REPO_ROOT/apps/lite/backend"
source ~/docuvision_lite_env/bin/activate
python -m pytest tests/test_lite_preview.py -q
```

## Phase B — Pro server + health

**Terminal 1** (keep running):

```bash
cd "$REPO_ROOT/backend"
source ~/docuvision_env/bin/activate
python run.py
```

**Terminal 2**:

```bash
export API_ROOT="http://127.0.0.1:8000"
curl -s -o /dev/null -w "HTTP %{http_code}\n" "$API_ROOT/health"
curl -s "$API_ROOT/health" | python3 -m json.tool | head -20
```

If **`HTTP 000`** → server not reachable. Fix `run.py`, port `8000`, retry.

Recommended `.env` for test windows: `DEBUG=false` (avoid uvicorn reload clearing in-memory `tasks`).

## Live API tests (`test_live_api.py`)

Requires **Phase B** server on `:8000`. Module auto-skips when health fails.

```bash
cd "$REPO_ROOT/backend"
source ~/docuvision_env/bin/activate
# Server must already be running in another terminal
pytest tests/test_live_api.py -q
```

**Invoice KIE only** (GPU; do not run during full `pytest tests/`):

```bash
pytest tests/test_live_api.py::TestLiveInvoiceKie -s
```

## Phase F — full backend pytest (exclude live)

```bash
cd "$REPO_ROOT/backend"
source ~/docuvision_env/bin/activate
pip install "httpx>=0.24,<0.28"
pytest tests/ -q --tb=short --ignore=tests/test_live_api.py
```

